+- `src/_pytest/tmpdir.py`: `get_user()` now rewrites the value from `getpass.getuser()` with `re.sub(r"[\W]", "_", user)`, so characters like `\`, `/`, spaces, etc. (illegal in directory names or acting as path separators) can no longer break the construction of the `pytest-of-<user>` base temp directory. This fixes `tmpdir`, `tmpdir_factory` and `tmp_path_factory` at once, since all of them ultimately go through `TempPathFactory.getbasetemp()` → `get_user()`.
